{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/21/7933257/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急に寒くなって困ってます。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11/17\n大阪スペシャルライブ＆似顔絵会\nありがとうございました(◌•ω•◌ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スペシャルライブの詳しい内容は\n名古屋が終わり次第書きますが、\n選抜アンダー研究生が\n混ざってパフォーマンスをすることは\nとっても新鮮で\n学べることもたくさんあり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チーム制ではない乃木坂の\n新たな形として\nとっても面白いライブに\nなったと思います(๑•̀‧̫•́๑)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋行く方も\n楽しみにしててくださいね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/21/7933257/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/21/7933257/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもやってる編み込みどうなってるのー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"説明しにくいんだけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭のてっぺんからサイドを編み込んで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/21/7933257/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのまま後ろまでいって、\n赤線の終わり(首の真ん中)まで来たら\n残った長さの髪を三つ編みして\n編み込みした所に入れ込んで\nピンで止める(๑⁰ -⁰)(黄色い線)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/21/7933257/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落書きしてないのも\n載せておくね(๑⁰ -⁰)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/21/7933257/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/21/7933257/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私的にこの髪型小顔に見えるから\n最近こればっかり(๑⁰ -⁰)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/21/7933257/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日が私の指定した日(13日ごと)\nの方のみ僭越ながら\nお祝いさせていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/21/7933257/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11.17 birthday!!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポコニャンさん\nちせさん\nイエローインクさん\nまことさん\nなほさん\n川後陽菜ちゃん推しのさやかさん\nたいちゃん@柴犬さんのお父様"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちと一緒に素敵な1年に\nしましょうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/21/7933257/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/21/7933257/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/21/7933257/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日次回予告 11月30日"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/21/7933257/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日あるお仕事をしてきたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても楽しくて充実して\n好きなことをお仕事に出来て\nとーっても幸せな気持ち"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/21/7933257/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また情報解禁になったら\nお知らせするねーっ(◌•ω•◌ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/21/7933257/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}